      "comment": "PAPER SHREDDER (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 23.02 beating Tommy Tsunami. Boasts a strong record from this draw with five wins and five minor placings from 12 starts. Great chance to get the job done again. LOCHINVAR GRACE (3) is better than last start when fourth (23.35) in a Free For All at this track over 400m. Has a good record here at this journey. Cannot be left out. LAURIE'S FERRARI (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 23.05 beating Barramundi Lou. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to measure up again. ZIPPING VIVID (2) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
